  "description": "Arcturus.ResultObjects is a lightweight, dependency-free .NET library for explicit, exception-free error handling. It provides Result and Result<T> types to model success/failure with rich error details, plus Maybe<T> for optional values. Includes functional helpers (Map, Bind, Match, Tap, Ensure), validation and error aggregation, async-friendly APIs, deconstruction support, and XML docs.",
